  "label": "Absurdity as a Humor Device",
  "description": "The humor in the meme is derived from the absurdity of the situation it portrays — the idea that one cannot lose an election that does not exist. This is a common comedic technique used to highlight the illogical or extreme nature of a situation, and understanding this device is necessary to appreciate the meme's intent.",
